<title>IRAQ: PRESS DIGEST - Iraq - Oct 26.</title>
<headline>PRESS DIGEST - Iraq - Oct 26.</headline>
<dateline>BAGHDAD 1996-10-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>These are some of the leading stories in the official Iraqi press on Saturday. Reuters has not verified these stories and does not vouch for their accuracy.</p>
<p>JUMHOURIYA</p>
<p>- French president says Iraq is a great country and asks for end to embargo.</p>
<p>- Food and Agriculture Organisation says Iraq needs $3 billion a year to meet food needs.</p>
<p>- National Assembly discusses means of solving environmental problems.</p>
<p>(Above stories were also carried by QADISSIYA and IRAQ.)</p>
</text>
